  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Add a \"Random\" button in the worlds menu somewhere that opens up details to an entirely random world not bound to any category in VRChat. It would essentially be the same as opening a world normally except you'd be picking one at random. This would be nice when you want to explore new worlds but there buried under other worlds. Every world has a random chance to be visited.",
